Embedded upstream provenance:

- Upstream repository: https://github.com/lz4/lz4
- Exact revision: 0774d05537f9762f838f7ab541b7765f1a729cb5
- Vendored files: vendor/lz4-1.10.0/lz4.c and lz4.h
- Original file SHA-256:
  - lz4.c: 53debdc44985bddbe4805e7f385ceae743598e90424b87798def5056363a6845
  - lz4.h: 774f26afe507c3ea4e781faca51dfcad719f60804526cef7fe223e3c3e534eef

The files have small, documented kernel-adaptation changes: Linux 4.9 type
headers replace unavailable libc headers; all upstream symbols are local to
gud.ko; stack-allocating entry points are excluded; and the external-state
bounded-output entry point is retained. See UPSTREAM.md.

The diagnostic source retains the full BSD notice and is linked into a
GPL-licensed kernel module.
